# Spec and method

OpenSpec and two Superpowers skills are part of this harness. Use the matching skill before a change that skill covers.

- OpenSpec lives in `openspec/`, the `openspec-*` skills, and the `/opsx-*` commands. It writes, updates, syncs, and archives the spec of a change. A GitHub board task is still read and planned with `board-task`. The coder implements the approved plan. `verify-task` checks it.
- `systematic-debugging` applies when a check fails or behavior is unexpected. `receiving-code-review` applies when review comments arrive. Both come from https://github.com/obra/superpowers (MIT, see `.cursor/skills/SUPERPOWERS.LICENSE`).
- The GitHub board task in this chat is the scope. `single-chat` decides which task is in this chat.
